# Backend Rules

Layered modules per domain: `routes`, `controller`, `service`, `repository`, `validator`, `dto`.

Docs: `docs/backend/`

- Controllers: validate → call service → respond. Zero business logic.
- Services: campaigns, calls, AI workflows, knowledge retrieval
- Prisma only; relations, indexes, constraints, transactions; avoid raw SQL
- Security on every route: Zod validation, JWT auth, RBAC, rate limiting, audit logs
- Never expose secrets/tokens in responses or logs
- Async work via BullMQ queues — never block request thread for dial/import/analytics
- AI: multi-language, context retention, barge-in, KB RAG, call summaries, stored conversation history
